# Coffee Cup — the OTD hello-world (8 statements)
scene "Coffee Cup"

cup = cylinder(top: 40mm, bottom: 30mm, height: 100mm) - hollow(wall: 3mm)
handle = torus(radius: 20mm, tube: 6mm) rotate (90deg, 0, 0) at (35mm, 25mm, 0)
add cup, handle

material cup: ceramic
color cup: ivory

ask "mass?"
ask "will it float?"
